Package: lunasurfer
Version: 0.3.7
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Goldisoft
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtwebenginewidgets, xdg-utils
Description: QtWebEngine web browser
 LunaSurfer is a tabbed desktop web browser powered by Qt 6 and QtWebEngine.
 It can pass the system-installed Widevine CDM to QtWebEngine when available, while using the helper selected by PySide6.
